"""
Juniper Mist Full API Clone Tool - Comprehensive Configuration Migration

This script provides complete coverage of the Juniper Mist API for cloning/migrating
configurations between organizations and sites. Based on the official Mist API documentation.

Supported Resources:
  ORGANIZATION LEVEL:
    - Sites, Site Groups
    - RF Templates, Network Templates, AP Templates, Gateway Templates
    - Org WLANs, Org PSKs, PSK Portals
    - WxLAN Rules, WxLAN Tags, WxLAN Tunnels
    - Networks, Services, Service Policies, Security Policies
    - VPNs, EVPN Topologies
    - Device Profiles (AP, Switch, Gateway)
    - Alarm Templates
    - Asset Filters, Org Assets
    - Mist Edge, Mist Edge Clusters
    - NAC Rules, NAC Tags, IDP Profiles
    - Webhooks
    - SDK Templates
    - WLAN Templates (full template objects)
    
  SITE LEVEL:
    - Site Settings
    - Site WLANs, Site PSKs
    - Maps (floorplans) - metadata only, images require separate handling
    - Zones, RSSI Zones
    - Virtual Beacons, Beacons
    - Assets, Asset Filters
    - WxLAN Rules, WxLAN Tunnels, WxLAN Tags
    - Networks, Services, Service Policies
    - Webhooks
    - Mist Edge (site-level), Mx Tunnels
    - EVPN Topologies
    - HA Clusters
    - Virtual Chassis configurations

  MSP LEVEL (if applicable):
    - MSP configuration
    - Org Groups
    - License management

Features:
  - Safe idempotent upserts (no deletes unless explicitly enabled)
  - Retries on 429/5xx errors with exponential backoff
  - Cross-region support (different API hosts for src/dst)
  - Dry-run mode for testing
  - Selective copy by resource type
  - JSON export/import for offline transfers
  - Detailed logging and progress reporting

Quick start:
  1. Edit the configuration section below
  2. chmod +x MistFullClone.py
  3. ./MistFullClone.py

API Reference: https://api.mist.com/api/v1/docs/
Rate Limit: 5000 calls/hour per token
"""

